name    mod-procedural-dungeon: below ProceduralDungeon.V2.MinPlayerLevel (80) nobody enters map 760
# Server-side test bot run (mod-fl-testbots), T1. Report #12 (2026-10-22): low-level characters entered the
# dungeon, whose mobs are all level 80; the operator 2026-10-26: "Mindestlevel 80 fuer pd". The director (not in
# GM mode) generates a fixed layout and asks to enter through PDv2DoEnter, the panel's path: at level 70 the level
# gate refuses it; at level 80 the next gate (the client handshake a bot session cannot pass) answers instead.
timeout 60s

bot a warrior
group none

place 727 13288.5 11776.2 -31.5
as gm .pdungeon v2 gen 434578084 1
expect output has "pdungeon v2: seed 434578084 theme 1"
as gm .character level Tbdirector 70
wait 1s
as gm .pdungeon v2 enter
expect output has "you need to be level 80"
as gm .character level Tbdirector 80
wait 1s
as gm .pdungeon v2 enter
expect output lacks "you need to be level"
expect gm map 727

cleanup
as gm .character level Tbdirector 80
